## 7. 每文件形态校验（S1-3 marker / 行宽 / CR）

```console
$ cd "F:/moonbit比赛/moon_textstat" && python - <<'PY'
import re
files = [
 "lib/data/easy_words_data.mbt",
 "lib/data/hyphenation_patterns_data.mbt",
 "lib/data/pronunciation_data.mbt",
 "lib/data/pronunciation_supplement_gb_data.mbt",
 "lib/gate/data/l3_data.mbt",
 "tools/l2_manifest.json",
]
total_violations = 0
for rel in files:
    b = open(rel, "rb").read()
    text = b.decode("utf-8")
    markers = text.count("DO NOT EDIT")
    cr = b.count(b"\r")
    lines = text.split("\n")
    maxcols = max(len(l) for l in lines)
    long_lines = sum(1 for l in lines if len(l) >= 65535)
    ok = markers == 1 and cr == 0 and maxcols < 65535
    total_violations += 0 if ok else 1
    print("SHAPE %-52s markers=%d CR=%d maxcols=%d lines>=65535=%d -> %s" % (rel, markers, cr, maxcols, long_lines, "OK" if ok else "VIOLATION"))
print("S1_3_VIOLATIONS=%d FILES=%d" % (total_violations, len(files)))
PY
SHAPE lib/data/easy_words_data.mbt                         markers=1 CR=0 maxcols=1170 lines>=65535=0 -> OK
SHAPE lib/data/hyphenation_patterns_data.mbt               markers=1 CR=0 maxcols=1201 lines>=65535=0 -> OK
SHAPE lib/data/pronunciation_data.mbt                      markers=1 CR=0 maxcols=1219 lines>=65535=0 -> OK
SHAPE lib/data/pronunciation_supplement_gb_data.mbt        markers=1 CR=0 maxcols=1216 lines>=65535=0 -> OK
SHAPE lib/gate/data/l3_data.mbt                            markers=1 CR=0 maxcols=128 lines>=65535=0 -> OK
SHAPE tools/l2_manifest.json                               markers=1 CR=0 maxcols=118 lines>=65535=0 -> OK
S1_3_VIOLATIONS=0 FILES=6
```

| 文件 | `DO NOT EDIT` 次数 | CR 字节 | 最长行（列） | < 65,535 | 判定 |
| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | :---: | --- |
| `lib/data/easy_words_data.mbt` | 1 | 0 | 1,170 | 是 | OK |
| `lib/data/hyphenation_patterns_data.mbt` | 1 | 0 | 1,201 | 是 | OK |
| `lib/data/pronunciation_data.mbt` | 1 | 0 | 1,219 | 是 | OK |
| `lib/data/pronunciation_supplement_gb_data.mbt` | 1 | 0 | 1,216 | 是 | OK |
| `lib/gate/data/l3_data.mbt` | 1 | 0 | 128 | 是 | OK |
| `tools/l2_manifest.json` | 1 | 0 | 118 | 是 | OK |

- S1 检索式 3（每个生成文件恰好 1 个「禁止手改」标记）：**零违规**（6/6 恰为 1）；
- 行宽上限（DR-R3 `E0033` 的 65,535 列）：最宽 1,219 列，余量充足；
- CR 字节：6/6 为 0（DR-R8 CRLF 陷阱不适用）；
- manifest 的唯一命中是 `"marker"` 字段的值（生成器同源常量 `MARKER`），不是注释，JSON 合法性未受影响
  （`--check` 的 `MANIFEST OK` 已复验）。

